{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32242","headline":"赠知音 · 温庭筠","name":"赠知音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠羽花冠碧树鸡，未明先向短墙啼。\n窗间谢女青蛾歛，门外萧郎白马嘶。\n星汉渐移庭竹影，露珠犹缀野花迷。\n景阳宫里钟初动，不语垂鞭上柳堤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}